      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Come join the Mood Swings Big Band conducted by Rick Becker for a fall dance! Doors Open at 7:00PM 7:30PM – 8:00PM: Swing Dance Lesson conducted by Vicki Linfit, instructor with Nanaimo Ball Room Dance Society 8:00PM: Bring your best swing dancing"
