    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "What is “New of Soul”? Aside from being the title of a song written by Island Soul Choir’s Music Director, Tom Arntzen, being “New of Soul” is discovering a newfound sense of self that creates a deeper connection to others and the greater universe."
